<title>UK: Bank of Nova Scotia sets $300 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Bank of Nova Scotia sets $300 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK OF NOVA SCOTIA</p>
<p> AMT    $300 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    16.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     -6.25 BP  PAY DATE    16.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.951    FULL FEES   0.125</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    99.951</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ONTARIO   HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.05	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
